      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested files, I need to create each file with the required AWS integration code. The scored implementation files will use AWS services to perform their specific tasks, while the local helper files will provide supporting utilities. Here's the plan:\n\n1. Create `moderate_text.py` to score user text for unsafe content using AWS Comprehend.\n2. Create `moderate_batch.py` to moderate a batch of user messages using AWS Comprehend.\n3. Create `redact_unsafe.py` to flag or redact unsafe spans from text using AWS Comprehend.\n4. Create `safety_threshold.py` to apply category thresholds to decide whether to allow text.\n5. Create `safety_client.py` to provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Text Content Safety.\n6. Create `safety_models.py` to define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Text Content Safety.\n7. Create `moderation_summary.py` to summarize moderation decisions using AWS Textract.\n8. Create `appeal_translate.py` to translate appeal text for review using AWS Translate.\n9. Create `moderation_reason_embedding.py` to embed moderation rationales for case retrieval using AWS SageMaker.\n10. Create `reviewer_brief_audio.py` to generate spoken briefs for moderation reviewers using AWS Polly. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789841994916,
          "start": 1789841981365
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
