        "text": "All requested files have been created successfully.\n\n- `moderate_text.py` uses AWS Comprehend to score user text for unsafe content.\n- `moderate_batch.py` uses AWS Comprehend to moderate a batch of user messages.\n- `redact_unsafe.py` uses AWS Comprehend to flag or redact unsafe spans from text.\n- `safety_threshold.py` applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text.\n- `safety_client.py` provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Text Content Safety.\n- `safety_models.py` defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Text Content Safety.\n- `moderation_summary.py` uses AWS Textract to summarize moderation decisions.\n- `appeal_translate.py` uses AWS Translate to translate appeal text for review.\n- `moderation_reason_embedding.py` uses AWS SageMaker to embed moderation rationales for case retrieval.\n- `reviewer_brief_audio.py` uses AWS Polly to generate spoken briefs for moderation reviewers.",
